      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REMEMBER DES (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Interrogation (19.99) in a Other. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from nine attempts. Likely to feature again. PRESSING MATTERS (4) missed the frame last time when fifth (26.42) at this track but prior to that had two placings in a row. Has a good record here at this journey. Goes well out of this box with a win and eight minor placings. Can do much better this time. WORPEL (6) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Bundaberg Gum (20.09) in a Other. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Expected to be in the finish again. CRUISER DANGER (2) is worth some thought after placing last start.",
